WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
Standing medium punch begins the near-corner target.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.600
OD Sprint reaches the Arc Step.

3
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:02.950
The follow-up kick launches Ryu.

4
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.600
Crouching light punch intentionally whiffs to set the next launcher timing.

5
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.500
Sprint launcher continues the juggle.

6
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.600
The red-punch plant places one heavy bomb; the can counter reads two.

7
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.250
Ryu rises beside the lit bomb.
